5574232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896180/extras/eb567fd2e7aa992fa4dac1d13d7c0971.mp4?t=1745574232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><br>And if you win...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can finally smash your friend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896180/extras/65bc96c84a5f50e878b2d09ae04b4bcf.poster.avif?t=1745574232\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896180/extras/65bc96c84a5f50e878b2d09ae04b4bcf.webm?t=1745574232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896180/extras/65bc96c84a5f50e878b2d09ae04b4bcf.mp4?t=1745574232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yeah, that's the general idea ahah.</p>",
